<Policy title="Privacy" description="Privacy for Energy Peptides.">
<p>Energy Wellness Club LLC, trading as Energy Peptides, collects the information needed to fulfil orders: contact details, shipping address, and order history. Card details are entered into our payment provider's secure tokenizer and never reach our servers.</p>
<h2>What we keep</h2>
<ul><li>Order records, including the research-use attestation and its timestamp.</li><li>Email correspondence about orders.</li><li>Membership status, calculated from your order history. If you confirm your email at checkout, we keep a hashed record of the confirmed device and set a cookie that remembers it for 90 days; one-time codes are stored only as hashes and expire after 10 minutes.</li></ul>
<h2>What we do not do</h2>
<ul><li>We do not sell or share customer data with third parties beyond the payment processor, the shipping carrier, and the email service that delivers verification codes.</li><li>We do not store card numbers.</li></ul>
<p>Requests to access or delete your data can be sent to support@energypeptides.us.</p>
</Policy>
